{
  "_comment": [
    "Every validation case, in one file, used by three runners:",
    "",
    "  tools/test-cases.sh    the shell shim  - checks expect, message and exports",
    "  pages/parity.html      the browser     - checks expect only",
    "",
    "There used to be two case files. A rule asserted in one and not the other is",
    "a rule that gets enforced in one place and not the other, which is exactly",
    "the failure this whole design exists to prevent. One file.",
    "",
    "`message` and `exports` are shim-only: the browser has no environment to",
    "export into and words its errors for a human, so it checks accept/reject.",
    "`raw_payload` sends a literal string instead of an object, for the",
    "malformed-JSON cases."
  ],
